# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# Archived design variants and superseded homepages are still built and served,
# but must not be indexed: they carry stale pricing and stale checkout links,
# and a search engine landing a buyer on one of them costs a sale. Handled here
# rather than as a prop on eleven pages so a new variant cannot forget it.
#
# The splat covers the route with and without a trailing slash. No live route
# begins with /v1../v4 — /videos/ is unaffected, it does not match /v1.
/v1*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/v2*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/v3*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/v4*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/home-old*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/editions/edition-2-funky*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
